# Force LF line endings for scripts that get submitted/run on SCITAS
# (Linux) regardless of a contributor's local core.autocrlf setting —
# Windows git clients commonly check these out as CRLF by default, and
# sbatch flatly refuses a script with CRLF ("Batch script contains DOS
# line breaks (\r\n) instead of expected UNIX line breaks (\n)").
*.sbatch text eol=lf
*.sh     text eol=lf
